<title>DENMARK: Danish July wholesale prices up 1.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish July wholesale prices up 1.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices were up 0.1 pct in July from June 1996 and 1.1 percent up on July 1995, the national statistics office said on Monday.  </p>
<p>					July 1996  June 1996  July 1995</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)  0.1	   0.1	     -0.1</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)   1.1	   0.9		2.9</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100) 104.2     104.1	     103.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
</text>
